    "fatGrams": 34.5
  },
  "ingredients": [
    "1 ounce cheddar cheese",
    "2 slice cooked bacon",
    "1 teaspoon fresh chives",
    "1 teaspoon lard (or other oil with a high smoke point)",
    "2 large egg",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Have the ingredients ready to go, as the omelet will cook quickly. Shred the cheese, fry up the bacon, and chop the chives.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/bacon-cheddar-chive-omelette/#wprm-recipe-51697-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/img_4273.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat up the bacon fat in a pan over medium-low heat (I used the leftover grease from frying the bacon). Once hot, add the eggs and season with the chives, salt, and pepper.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/bacon-cheddar-chive-omelette/#wprm-recipe-51697-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/img_4283.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once the edges are starting to set, add the bacon to the middle and let them cook together for 20–30 seconds longer before turning off the heat.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/bacon-cheddar-chive-omelette/#wprm-recipe-51697-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/img_4285.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the cheese on top of the bacon, making sure it's centered. Then, take two edges of the omelet and fold them over the cheese. Hold the sides there for a moment, as the cheese has to partially melt so that it can \"glue\" the edges in place.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/bacon-cheddar-chive-omelette/#wprm-recipe-51697-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/img_4293.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Do the same with the other edges, creating a burrito of sorts, then flip over and let the omelet cook in the warm pan for a little longer.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/bacon-cheddar-chive-omelette/#wprm-recipe-51697-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/img_4298.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/bacon-cheddar-chive-omelette/#wprm-recipe-51697-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
